          {
            "typeName": "relatedMaterial",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Meta-data information: For all experiments a excel file recording meta-data for all of the collected data is include. This includes information about last edits to the data set, permissions, and how the data was collected.\r\n\r\nSyntax Files: For experiments the syntax/scripts used to process and analyze the data are included. These are provided in either SPSS syntax or R script. With these, the statistical analysis can be replicated.\r\n\r\nSurveys: For all experiments the experimental materials are available. All data was collected using a Qualtrics online survey. A PDF version of all questions is included. For people who want to directly upload the Qualtrics file (which also includes all survey logic pre-programmed) the .qsf can be directly uploaded into a Qualtrics account and the experiment can be directly replicated.\r\n\r\nProject Documentation: This data package includes a .txt file with project documentation. This includes the responsibilities of the three authors while collecting, analyzing and storing the data."
            ]
